sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as AuthController
    participant S as AuthService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    U->>W: email + password
    W->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A->>S: LoginAsync(dto)
    S->>DB: load user by email
    alt not verified or locked out
        S-->>A: failure
        A-->>W: 401 - message identical to a wrong password
    else valid
        S->>S: BCrypt.Verify
        S->>S: issue access token (60 min)
        S->>DB: store refresh token hash (14 days)
        S-->>A: tokens
        A-->>W: 200
    end

    Note over W,DB: later - access token expires
    W->>A: POST /api/auth/refresh
    A->>S: RefreshAsync(token)
    S->>DB: match hash
    alt token already rotated
        S->>DB: invalidate the whole chain
        S-->>A: replay detected
        A-->>W: 401 - re-authenticate
    else current
        S->>DB: rotate - old invalidated, new stored
        S-->>A: new pair
        A-->>W: 200
    end
